===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nl|dum|scholle}}, {{m|dum|scolle}}, {{m|dum|sculle}}. Related to Dutch {{m|nl|schil}} and {{m|nl|schel}}. Cognate with {{cog|de|Scholle||floe}}. {{etystub|nl}}

